// 200 mixed units cross one bridge to a goal area (WP4.3, the flowfields of
// docs/rules/pathfinding.md; the "done when" of phase 4 in PLAN.md). The map is
// assets/maps/bridge, a flat 96 by 64 cell map made by
// `cargo run -p sf_headless --example gen_bridge_map -- assets/maps/bridge`:
//
//   x 0..43              x 44..49           x 50..95
//   the west bank, rock  the river (water,  the east bank: rock outcrops either
//   outcrops funnelling  every row) with    side of the bridge's mouth, a rock wall
//   toward the bridge    ONE bridge, rows   (x 66..67, every row) with a gap in rows
//                        31..33             36..40, then open ground
//
// The 200 units stand on a block of 20 by 10 cells (x 8..27, y 26..35), one to a cell,
// in the order of the cells (rows first), and get ONE order on tick 1: go to (80, 32),
// behind the wall's gap. The slots are the entity ids; the mix is a repeating
// pattern of 13 and one hover craft every 40 cells (all at generation 0):
//
//   90 riflemen (foot)  60 light tanks (tracked)  45 light transports (wheeled)
//    5 amphibious transports (hover)
//
// Foot, tracked and wheeled are each at least the flowfield threshold (8), so
// the order gives three fields, one per class; the five hover craft are below it and
// are routed one by one (and swim across the river). Without collision (WP4.4)
// the units overlap on the bridge and at the goal; that is expected for now.
//
// tools/sf_headless/tests/bridge_200.rs asserts that all of them arrive, how long
// it takes, that at most 1 % end outside 5 cells of the goal, that no unit ever
// ends a tick on ground its class cannot enter, and that the path service never
// spends more than its budget in a tick. CI runs the scenario on Linux and
// Windows and requires the checksum in bridge_200.expected. `unit_defs` is the
// frozen copy of the definitions `pathing` uses, so a rebalance of assets/config/
// does not move the checksum.

Scenario(
    name: "bridge_200",
    seed: 0x7E44_0044,
    map: (width: 96, height: 64),
    map_name: Some("bridge"),
    unit_defs: Some("pathing_defs"),
    ticks: 2400,
    commands: [
